Description: low-latency capture-card viewer and hardware recorder
 MyGOFrame displays a V4L2 capture device in a native MyGo window and
 monitors a selected PipeWire audio input through speakers or headphones.
 Video format, resolution, frame rate, and color range are selectable.
 A separate video-only window supports application sharing.
 Hardware recording supports H.264, HEVC, and AV1 on compatible GPUs,
 with independent capture-audio recording and speaker monitoring.
 Named presets save capture and recording settings. Native dialogs show
 application information and complete third-party license notices.
